@startuml
autonumber

title US209 - View Airport Routes — Simplified Sequence Diagram

actor "Air Transport Company Collaborator" as ATCC
participant ":System" as Sys

ATCC -> Sys: Request all routes departing from or arriving at a specific airport
Sys --> ATCC: Request airport identifier (iataCode)

ATCC -> Sys: Inserts airport iataCode
Sys --> ATCC: Retrieves and displays the list of flight routes linked to that airport

@enduml